or his whereabouts.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2008-10-01","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dOA3OpU9lv4Gc5XUenezMTYApQg.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dOA3OpU9lv4Gc5XUenezMTYApQg.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34750/season/1/episode/3"},{"id":"791408","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"While becoming accustomed to his new environment, Akiyuki begins the distinctive training in order to control his powers.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2008-10-01","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aUYluD59mifphBwMcVvUZE8FqMu.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aUYluD59mifphBwMcVvUZE8FqMu.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34750/season/1/episode/4"},{"id":"791409","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Nakiami meets some old acquaintances of hers, and the rest of the crew wonders if she will leave the ship to join them. Meanwhile, a classmate of Haru and Furuichi who lost her entire family surrenders herself to despair.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2008-10-08","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/uE2NC4T4d1YU5zqoN6RsW2sNB5i.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uE2NC4T4d1YU5zqoN6RsW2sNB5i.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34750/season/1/episode/5"},{"id":"791410","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":6,"title":{"value":"Episodio 6","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Haru finally got news from Akiyuki, but just after she and Furuichi joined the military, they are assigned to engage a rogue Xam'd who broke out from a research lab.","language":