ame feeling.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2008-10-22","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/s3vytS21pVgKfuSDn4BpKr6YOTc.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/s3vytS21pVgKfuSDn4BpKr6YOTc.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34750/season/1/episode/9"},{"id":"791414","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":10,"title":{"value":"Episodio 10","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Raigyo asks for the crew to take a picture together while Haru decides to follow with her military career.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2008-10-22","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qJQsCxhb64rVGbT22IovbcdezEA.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qJQsCxhb64rVGbT22IovbcdezEA.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34750/season/1/episode/10"},{"id":"791415","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":11,"title":{"value":"Episodio 11","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The crew of the Zanbani must fend off an assault by Humanforms from the Northern forces.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2008-10-29","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6aHPjSkxlSo3lbJlKhJ4hlP2JPB.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6aHPjSkxlSo3lbJlKhJ4hlP2JPB.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34750/season/1/episode/11"},{"id":"791416","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":12,"title":{"value":"Episodio 12","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"After the incident at the Zanbani, Nakiami decides to return to her homeland and Akiyuki asks to go with her. Meanwhile, Haru pays a visit to Furuichi and finds that he too, became a Xam'd.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2008-10-29","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/